  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Orange Tea.png|200px|left|Orange tea]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 89\n |price = 1 to 255\n |time = 40 min\n |source = {{Infoicon|teas|bigger|link=Tea Stand}}\n |xp = 30\n |base = 71\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 34 min\n}}\n'''Orange tea''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 89. It is not used to make any other product.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making orange tea'''===\n[[File:Tea Stand.png|150px|left|Tea Stand]]\nOrange tea is made in the [[Tea Stand]].\n\nTo make the tea, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Orange.png|75px|link=Orange|Orange]]\n|[[File:Tea Leaf.png|75px|link=Tea Leaf|Tea leaves]]\n|-\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x3'''\n|}\nIt takes 40 minutes to make one cup of tea, and 34 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] stand. Each cup gives players 30 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling orange tea'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n* Orange tea can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,556 {{Infoicon|coin}} for 10 cups.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make the tea costs 226 {{Infoicon|coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 2 orange tea per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Orangentee\n|es = Té con naranja\n|fr = Thé à l'orange\n|it = Tè all'arancia\n|nl = Sinaasappel Thee\n|no = Appelsinte\n|ru = Чай с апельсином\n|zh = Orange Tea\n}}\n[[pt-br:Chá com laranja]]\n\n[[Category:Tea Stand Products]]\n[[Category:Orange Products]]\n[[Category:Tea Leaf Products]]",
